ow is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry ${c}_{22}\\ne 0$ (condition II is violated). \n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $C$ is **not** in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186413824 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47c544f2-0094-5efb-b9d7-430a6628b03a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473118} {:answer/id #uuid "d6421a79-149e-5798-8b1f-119bfea53fe3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473119}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473118} :answer-field/id #uuid "fafc7937-f74b-546b-b87e-a22ca804ac3f" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473954} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a89bbf83-2e3e-5555-a6d5-981a9278f764" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473120} {:answer/id #uuid "cea56d01-fdfe-5736-816e-b8204e960080" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473121}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186473120} :answer-field/id #uuid "8372ee30-4548-5d83-9957-bf0d65799b1f" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473955} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc580dff-bc2e-5878-b7a7-f48a863b4636" :answer/typ